<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', backgroundColor: '#FAFCFE', padding: 0, position: 'relative', overflow: 'hidden' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 64, top: 36, width: '1152px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ background: '#0E9B78', borderRadius: 5, padding: '3px 11px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>第 10 节</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16232E' }}>核心知识点</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5A6B7A', marginTop: 10 }}>· 列表是什么、索引为什么从 0 开始</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: '1280px', height: '720px' }}>
        <svg width='1280' height='720' viewBox='0 0 1280 720'>
            <rect x='64' y='96' width='368' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='64' y='96' width='368' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='82' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.1 列表：一个名字，一排抽屉</text><text x='82' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 到目前为止，变量只能装一个值。但现实中数据总是成组</text><text x='82' y='188.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>的：一串商品名、一堆分数、一串待办事项。</text><rect x='468' y='96' width='368' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='468' y='96' width='368' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='486' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.2 索引从 0 开始：为什么不是从 1 开始</text><text x='486' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 越界会报 IndexError：cars[3] 或 cars[-4] 都会崩</text><text x='486' y='188.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>。</text><rect x='872' y='96' width='368' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='872' y='96' width='368' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='890' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.3 列表是可变的：能直接改</text><text x='890' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 列表元素可以是任意类型，包括另一个列表（叫嵌套列表</text><text x='890' y='188.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>）：</text><rect x='64' y='574' width='1152' height='66' rx='12' fill='#EEF5FB' /><text x='84' y='616' fontSize='14' fill='#243444' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>看不懂的地方先回讲义对应小节读一遍，再回来对着这页复述一次——能讲出来才算真懂。</text>
            <text x='64' y='684' fontSize='13' fill='#8A9AAA' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>Python 讲授课件 · 逐节版</text>
            <text x='1216' y='684' fontSize='13' fill='#8A9AAA' textAnchor='end' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>单元 2 · 第 10 节</text>
        </svg>
    </Box>
</Slide>
